      "message": "[error] Line 1488: 🔴 `applyContactMetadata` unconditionally decodes `metadata[\"labels\"]`. If `contactMetadataChanged` delivers a partial metadata delta that does not include the `labels` key, this resolves to `null` and clears existing labels (`emptySet`) on unrelated metadata updates. Only update labels when `metadata` actually contains `ContactLabels.METADATA_KEY` (or merge with the current value) so non-label metadata changes cannot erase labels.",
